    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Fastest-growing supplement format</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Gummies are the fastest-growing supplement format in consumer health, especially with millennial and Gen Z audiences. The right choice when your brand wants to ride a high-momentum category.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">High-palatability, broad appeal</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Gummies feel like a treat, not a pill. Strong fit for daily-supplement positioning where taste and ease matter. Particularly effective for product categories where compliance (taking the supplement daily) is the main customer barrier.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Sugar-free and pectin-based options</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Traditional gelatin-and-sugar formulations or modern sugar-free, pectin-based vegan formulations. Sugar-free positioning has become the default for new launches.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207157041,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">SPECIFICATIONS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Manufacturing specs available for private label gummies.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 760px; margin: 22px auto 0;\">The most common questions from brand owners are about sizes, materials, fill capacity, and minimums. Here is the short answer for each.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207157042,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\"></h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\"></p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Standard or Custom</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Shapes & Sizes</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Standard bear, ring, and square shapes available with no tooling cost. Custom shapes (brand logos, mascots, themed designs) available for higher-volume runs.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Gelatin or Pectin</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Base Options</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Gelatin-based gummies are traditional and lower-cost. Pectin-based gummies are vegan, kosher, halal compatible, and have become standard for new launches with clean-label positioning.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Sugar / Sugar-Free</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Sweetener Options</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Traditional cane sugar formulations for taste-forward positioning. Sugar-free using allulose, monk fruit, or stevia for low-sugar positioning. Mixed natural-fruit formulations also available.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Higher MOQ</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Minimums & Set-Up</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Gummy manufacturing has higher minimums than other formats due to depositing line setup and drying time. No set-up fees, but lead time and MOQ are scoped carefully during discovery.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207157043,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Gummies manufacturing\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">MANUFACTURING</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">How we manufacture gummies for private label.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Gummies are manufactured on starch-molding and pectin-deposit lines. The base is cooked, actives are blended in at controlled temperature, the slurry is deposited into starch or silicone molds, then dried, demolded, and finished with a thin oil or wax coating for non-stick handling. Every batch goes through identity, purity, potency, microbial, and (critically) active-stability testing before release, since heat exposure during cooking can affect sensitive ingredients.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207157044,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 50px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Want to see gummies samples or talk through your formulation?</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #012638; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Request Samples</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
